{"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Benchmarks","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The benchmark suite measures the same workloads at several committed FirebladeECS revisions, such as a release tag against ","type":"text"},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The workloads cover entity creation, destruction and lookup, adding and removing components, iterating families, system updates and component events. Revisions with value-type components run each workload on both the ","type":"text"},{"code":"archetype","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the ","type":"text"},{"code":"sparseSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" storage (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), so a report also shows what the storage choice costs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-results-are-made-trustworthy","level":3,"text":"How results are made trustworthy"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each revision is built once and measured in ","type":"text"},{"code":"k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" independent process replicates, interleaved in a seeded random order. The replicate is the unit of analysis: the centre value is the median of the replicate medians, with a distribution-free order-statistic 95% confidence interval. A speed-up against the baseline is the Hodges–Lehmann estimate with its exact confidence interval, tested with an exact Mann–Whitney test and adjusted across all comparisons of a report with Benjamini–Hochberg. A change counts as ","type":"text"},{"code":"faster","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"slower","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only when it is significant and clears the ±5% equivalence zone; an interval inside that zone is reported as ","type":"text"},{"code":"equivalent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", anything else as ","type":"text"},{"code":"inconclusive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Read-and-reproduce","level":3,"text":"Read and reproduce"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The first published report comes with the 2.0.0 release.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The statistical design and workload parity notes: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To measure revisions locally, pass comma-separated tags, branches or commit IDs. Results are saved under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Benchmarks\/Results\/<UTC timestamp>\/"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"sh","code":["make benchmark-compare REFS=1.4.3,main REPLICATES=10 BENCHMARK_FILTER='.*'","make benchmark-report RESULTS=\"Benchmarks\/Results\/<run>\/*.json\" REPORT_BASELINE=1.4.3"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Without ","type":"text"},{"code":"BENCHMARK_FILTER","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only 16 entities of every workload plus ","type":"text"},{"code":"entity.create.no-entities","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (which only has 0 entities) run. ","type":"text"},{"code":"make benchmark-report","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" renders the single file ","type":"text"},{"code":"BenchmarkReport.html","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from saved results and never runs benchmarks. See ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Benchmarks\/README.md"},{"text":" for all options.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Benchmarks","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"See how FirebladeECS revisions compare on a shared workload suite, and run the comparison yourself."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"],"anchor":"Essentials"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/benchmarks"]}],"references":{"https://github.com/fireblade-engine/ecs/blob/main/Documentation/Benchmarks/Methodology.md":{"type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Methodology.md"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md","title":"Methodology.md"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus/StorageKind":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus\/storagekind","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StorageKind"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The storage a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps its entities and components in."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StorageKind"}],"title":"Nexus.StorageKind"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"A lightweight, fast and easy to use Entity-Component System in Swift.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs","type":"topic","title":"FirebladeECS"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/MigratingToFirebladeECS2":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/migratingtofirebladeecs2","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Move a project from FirebladeECS 1.x to 2.0: components become value types, and every write goes through the nexus."}],"kind":"article","title":"Migrating to FirebladeECS 2","type":"topic","role":"article"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ChoosingAStorage":{"kind":"article","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pick the sparse-set or the archetype storage for a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and know what changes."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/choosingastorage","type":"topic","title":"Choosing a storage"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/NexusEvent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nex